  "title": "HB 835 (113th General Assembly): AN ACT to amend Tennessee Code Annotated, Section 2-2-106 and Section 2-2-141, relative to election integrity.",
  "urls": [
    "https://legiscan.com/TN/bill/HB0835/2023",
